%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "28px", "fontFamily": "Arial", "primaryBorderColor": "#333333", "lineColor": "#333333"}, "sequence": {"showSequenceNumbers": false, "mirrorActors": false, "actorMargin": 90, "messageMargin": 80, "boxMargin": 16, "boxTextMargin": 10, "noteMargin": 14}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  participant B as BackendService
  participant D as DSP + calidad
  participant A as Adaptador<br/>sonificación
  participant G as Generadores<br/>musicales
  participant S as Scheduler<br/>MIDI
  participant T as Transporte<br/>Bridge
  participant F as Firmware<br/>MIDI OUT

  B->>D: ventana CH1 lista<br/>4 s + hop 64
  D-->>B: features + diagnostics<br/>+ SpectralQuality
  B->>A: update(features, quality)
  A-->>B: SonificationFeatures<br/>controles 0..1

  alt calidad válida y periodo de compás
    B->>G: construir segmento<br/>compás y notas
    G-->>B: lista NoteEvent
    B->>S: program_change<br/>+ schedule_notes()
  else calidad insuficiente
    B->>B: no generar nuevo compás útil
  end

  B->>S: pop_due_events(now, lookahead)
  S-->>B: eventos MIDI vencidos
  B->>T: send_events(events)
  T->>T: event_to_midi_bytes()
  T->>F: Bridge.call("midi_bytes", n, b0, b1, b2)
  F->>F: Serial1/D1 invertido<br/>31250 baudios

  opt Panic MIDI
    B->>S: panic()
    S-->>T: All Sound Off<br/>All Notes Off
    T->>F: midi_bytes
  end
